  "Scope": "Packed rows skip inactive consuming cells using following-row successor bits, then reuse existing epsilon order. Two masks, compact epsilon order, conservative existing admission/cache charge; no reverse-edge array, framework, mode or accounting exemption. Per-atom direct InputStep, exact total numeric invocation work/bits/arrays/loans, wide rows and ordered replay unchanged. Fifteen public cases: canonical LF region46429B Count ordinary/compiled/live/finite-live/deadline-live; Unicode/wide/nullable/dense ASCII\u002Bsupplementary/category Count and category IsMatch control; unchanged nonNB/literal; typed public native UTF8 Compile plus first-empty-Count with nonNB cold-construction control. Cold rows label their different four lanes explicitly, not BCL comparison. Full subject validation included, setup excluded for throughput; cold rows include compilation/first-empty execution every call. Warm1s/min64, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples\u003E=20ms, full result batches checked afterward. One120s cap, at most one noise confirmation. No full package/catalog/unchecked-access campaign.",
